  "title": "Support for TDS SSPI Token parsing.",
  "description": "Support for TDS SSPI Token parsing. TDS SSPI Token exchanges SSPI buffer which can be parsed as NTLMSSP or GSSAPI.\nTDS SSPI token includes a SHORT token length and buffer of that length.\n\nWithout this patch:\n![image](/uploads/bcf45e0fc85868901fa7964dcd9cd13e/image.png)\n\nWith patch:\n![image](/uploads/ad67f4c2c3674e2f2a84482dbb4e308a/image.png)",
